          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-16932 tests: observe HSM requests before shortening timeout",
        "message": "LU-16932 tests: observe HSM requests before shortening timeout\n\nA one-second request timeout can expire before the test sees\nSTARTED. This fails test_251 and leaves the shortened timeout\nin effect for later tests, including test_254b.\n\nShorten the timeout after observing STARTED and restore the\ncoordinator parameters on every exit from the test.\n\nFixes: 1e3d2aa9cf53 (\"LU-8950 tests: do not use make_custom_file_for_progress()\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-hsm\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ib55d02663441a169a7fc6a57f9c5c5697bf4834d\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
